  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">新增儲存單元，讓你能在 ME 系統中儲存能量（FE）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/906/413/fe_cells_new.png\" width=\"664\" height=\"226\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用通量存取器來操作 ME 系統中儲存的能量。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/906/414/flux_accessor_new.png\" width=\"651\" height=\"415\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">最大的儲存單元可儲存超過 200 兆 FE！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/906/415/large_cell_new.png\" width=\"624\" height=\"255\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你可以在終端機中直接查看已儲存的能量數量，並為物品進行充放電。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/906/416/terminal_new.png\" width=\"803\" height=\"435\"></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
